<section class="py-20" style="background-color: #D4E7F4;">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-24">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <p class="text-sm leading-normal font-bold" style="color: #3a5a8c;">
        mobile app features
      </p>
      <h2
        class="text-xl leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl mt-4 font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-text-primary)">
        What you need when therapy isn't available
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary)">
        Built for CPTSD survivors in therapy who need support between sessions. Process flashbacks, understand triggers, and regulate your nervous system—available 24/7 when you need it most.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Primary Features -->
    <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 justify-center mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Trauma-Informed Support Companion -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl hover:scale-[1.02] transition bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-6 flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color: #3a5a8c;">
            <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-center" style="color: var(--color-text-primary)">Process flashbacks in real-time</h3>
        <p class="text-base font-medium text-center leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary)">
          When you're triggered at 2am and therapy isn't until Thursday, describe what you're feeling (voice or text) and get trauma-informed support to help you make sense of it. Available 24/7 when you need it most.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Daily Healing Tracker -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl hover:scale-[1.02] transition bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-6 flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color: #3a5a8c;">
            <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-center" style="color: var(--color-text-primary)">Know what to tell your therapist</h3>
        <p class="text-base font-medium text-center leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary)">
          Track what happened between sessions so you can show up prepared. Log when you worked through a trigger, set a boundary, or regulated your nervous system. See your progress and know exactly what to discuss in your next appointment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Nervous System Regulation Tools -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl hover:scale-[1.02] transition bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-6 flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color: #3a5a8c;">
            <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-center" style="color: var(--color-text-primary)">Interrupt a flashback when it's happening</h3>
        <p class="text-base font-medium text-center leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary)">
          When you recognize you're in a flashback but don't know how to stop it, access 60-90 second regulation exercises (Butterfly Hug, Box Breathing, Orienting, Body Shake, Cross-Lateral Movement, Humming). Science-backed techniques to calm your nervous system in the moment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Insights Tab -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl hover:scale-[1.02] transition bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-6 flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color: #3a5a8c;">
            <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-center" style="color: var(--color-text-primary)">See what triggers your freeze response</h3>
        <p class="text-base font-medium text-center leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary)">
          Figure out what sets you off by seeing patterns in your flashbacks. Identifies when you're in freeze, fight, flight, or fawn. Tracks trigger themes and core beliefs so you can understand your responses and prepare for what's coming.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
